Attribution
-----------

The wave-runner asset used by the demo:

  demo/craftModel.js   mesh and inlined base-colour texture, generated with
                       Meshy.ai under a paid plan (which carries commercial use
                       rights) and converted by tools/glb.mjs

It is used only by the demo application. The library published as the
`abyssal-ocean` package (the `src/` directory) contains no third-party assets,
no bundled models and no bundled textures.
